      "devanagari": "ते विषादार्तवदना रहितास्तेन धिमता |\nकृपणाः करुणा वाचो वदन्ति स्म मनस्विनः",
      "iast": "te viśhādārtavadanā rahitāstena dhimatā |\nkṛpaṇāḥ karuṇā vāco vadanti sma manasvinaḥ",
      "translation": "Their faces distorted with sorrow, deprived as they were of sagacious Rama and therefore non-pulsed, the citizens broke into piteous exclamations, saying:-",
