    {
      "id": "2.47.4",
      "label": "2.47.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "धिगस्तु खलु निद्राम् ताम् ययापहृतचेतसः |\nनाद्य पश्यामहे रामम् पृथूरस्कम् महाभुजम्",
      "iast": "dhigastu khalu nidrām tām yayāpahṛtacetasaḥ |\nnādya paśyāmahe rāmam pṛthūraskam mahābhujam",
      "translation": "\"Cursed be to that slumber, rendered unconscious, by which we could not behold today that mighty armed Rama with a broad chest.\"",
