    {
      "id": "2.47.7",
      "label": "2.47.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "इहैव निधनम् यामो महाप्रस्थानमेव वा |\nरामेण रहितानाम् हि किमर्थम् जीवितम् हि नः",
      "iast": "ihaiva nidhanam yāmo mahāprasthānameva vā |\nrāmeṇa rahitānām hi kimartham jīvitam hi naḥ",
      "translation": "\"Let us have recourse to death here itself, or definitely set out for a grand journey ( to the north with a resolve to die). For what purpose can life be good for us, separated as we are from Rama?\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
