      "label": "2.47.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "किम् व्ख्स्यामो महाबाहुरनसूयः प्रियम्वद |\nनीतः स राघवोऽस्माभिर्ति वक्तुम् कथम् क्षमम्",
      "iast": "kim vkhsyāmo mahābāhuranasūyaḥ priyamvada |\nnītaḥ sa rāghavo'smābhirti vaktum katham kśamam",
      "translation": "\"What shall we say to our fellow citizens? �The great armed Rama who is free from egoism and who speaks kindly ( to all ) has been conveyed to the forest by us!' How can we say so?\"",
