    {
      "id": "2.47.14",
      "label": "2.47.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "रथस्य मार्ग नाशेन न्यवर्तन्त मनस्विनः |\nकिम् इदम् किम् करिष्यामः दैवेन उपहताइति",
      "iast": "rathasya mārga nāśena nyavartanta manasvinaḥ |\nkim idam kim kariṣyāmaḥ daivena upahatāiti",
      "translation": "The good-natured citizens, due to disappearance of the tracks of the chariot, returned to Ayodhya, saying thus, \" How is it? What shall we do? We are afflicted by providence\"",
      "notes": [],
